    "note": "Field uniform (Feldanzug, Heer): the olive rank slide (Aufschiebeschlaufe) on the camouflage shoulder strap, devices woven in black (BPrDGrUnifAnO para 5(3): black or white replace silver on the Kampfanzug; TL 8455-0009 Anhang A 'DG Schwarz auf Oliv'). Medium (official-text extracts): device kinds and counts per Anlage 2 (1-4 Schraegstreifen; Tresse open at the bottom / closed; closed Tresse with 1 or 2 Winkel point up or a Kopfwinkel; 1 or 2 stars); the Litze in the Waffenfarbe on the Feldanzug strap, Heer only, 4 mm wide (bundeswehr.de), green (Jaegergruen) for Panzergrenadiere. Medium-low: slide 90 mm long, 52 mm wide at the collar end, 60 mm at the shoulder end (one TL 8455-0009 extract and a shop; not reproduced). Low (inferred, no drawing readable): every device size and position (stripes 5 mm with 3 mm gaps at 35 deg; Tresse 7 mm, 2 mm in; Winkel 5 mm band, 100 deg; stars four-pointed, 17 mm, from 24 mm above the shoulder end), the Kopfwinkel's shape (drawn Odal-like), the stripes' direction, the strap's shape and colour, the Litze's place 3 mm below the slide and its hex colour. Search extracts only; no page could be opened."
